Výchozí `keep` · standardy: perCs `keep`, psr12 `keep`, nette `forbidden`, symfony `keep`, laravel `keep` · pokrývá `SlevomatCodingStandard.Classes.SuperfluousInterfaceNaming` .[decision-facts]


